  "quote": "The results support a positive relationship between alcohol consumption and all-cause mortality (OR by 8 grams higher daily alcohol intake 1·27, 95% CI 1·16–1·39), CVD mortality (1·30, 1·10–1·53), cancer mortality (1·20, 1·08–1·33), and digestive mortality (2·06, 1·36–3·12)",
  "pmid": "38508868",
  "estimand_zh": "遗传预测的长期平均饮酒量每增加 8 g/天（=56 g/周，原文单位为 8 g/天，换算为周）的全因死亡比值比（因果估计，非现饮酒者对比从不饮酒者的观察性 HR；注意原文报告 OR 而非 HR）",
